<section image-layout="blank" id="ANgowHxrXr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="pDBvjEM_n1" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Nguyễn Du · The Tale of Kiều</p><h1 font-size="44pt">A poem carried by its rhythm</h1><p font-size="19pt"><b><i>Truyện Kiều</i> turns a life under pressure into a test of how we judge choice.</b></p><spacer size="16pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="xBahEwe6u4" background-color="surface" text-color="#241D19" padding="14pt 16pt"><p role="eyebrow">Opening sound</p><h3 font-size="19pt">Trăm năm trong cõi người <span text-color="accent">ta</span><br/>Chữ tài chữ mệnh khéo <span text-color="accent">là</span> ghét nhau</h3><p font-size="14pt"><b>Six syllables → eight syllables</b> · <span text-color="accent">ta–là</span> rhyme bridge</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="14pt">Original Vietnamese evidence; no claim that an English paraphrase preserves the meter.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="6Go0Byn5TO" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/QtwXbwgOWg-DMCIf.png" saved-media-id="dnednlm4384rxpz" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, an open manuscript folio without legible writing beside a river threshold and a narrow vermilion cord passing forward through the composition, Vietnamese chữ Nôm woodblock sensibility, lampblack, old gold and indigo under soft window light, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:864,&quot;height&quot;:1152}"></grid-item></grid><shape preset="line" x="56" y="486" w="848" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape></section>